    "notes": "As of 2026-10-07, bounded regulator and issuer searches located no ZARm/Mento-specific GENIUS PPSI approval, state qualification, official application, foreign registration/comparability decision, issuer-announced GENIUS route or public enforcement action. Legal issuer, domicile and pathway remain unresolved; Mento Labs GmbH infrastructure/operational attribution is not a fixed-fiat redemption issuer disclosure. Current governance includes upgrade/admin controls; the 2024 issuerless analysis is not conclusive and MGP-19 is a proposal, not proven execution. The protocol dashboard is public collateral disclosure, not evidence of GENIUS-compliant reserve composition or monthly independent attestation. No holder-facing contractual fiat-redemption policy was found in the opened product/protocol materials; third-party offramps and USDm swaps do not establish one. The SCRC procedural rule is effective but issuer standards/application rules reviewed remain proposed; no earlier final-rule trigger was found. DASP status is a pre-effective assessment, conditional on scope, not permission or compliance. Treasury distinguishes foreign lawful-order conditions at effectiveness from the broader July 18 2028 DASP restriction.",
